 "questions": [
  {
   "id": 505901,
   "is_answer_order_important": false,
   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "Simplify <span data-math=\"\\frac{{{5^4}}}{{{5^8}}}\">\\frac{{{5^4}}}{{{5^8}}}</span>.",
   "answers": [],
   "hints": [],
   "formats": [
    "free-response"
   ],
   "combo_choices": [],
   "collaborator_solutions": [
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "summary",
     "content_html": "<p>Use the quotient rule: <span data-math=\"\\frac{{{a^n}}}{{{a^m}}} = {a^{\\left( {n - m} \\right)}}\"></span>.</p>\n<p><span data-math=\"\\frac{{{5^4}}}{{{5^8}}} = {5^{\\left( {4 - 8} \\right)}} = {5^{ - 4}}\"></span></p>\n<p>Alternate answer option:</p>\n<p>Use the negative exponent rule. <span data-math=\"{a^{ - n}} = \\frac{1}{{{a^n}}}\"></span> provided that <i>a</i> ≠ 0.</p>\n<p><span data-math=\"{5^{ - 4}} = \\frac{1}{{{5^4}}}\"></span></p>"
    },
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "detailed",
     "content_html": "<span data-math=\"{5^{ - 4}}\">{5^{ - 4}}</span> or <span data-math=\"\\frac{1}{{{5^{\\text{4}}}}}\">\\frac{1}{{{5^{\\text{4}}}}}</span>"
    }
   ],
   "community_solutions": []
  }
 ],
